    "result": "Excellent! My implementation of the threshold feature is complete. Here's a summary of what I've implemented:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n### 1. **Core Logic** (`packages/frai-core/src/eval/index.js`)\n- Added `validateThresholds()` function to validate threshold configuration\n- Modified `generateReport()` to accept optional `thresholds` parameter\n- Implemented threshold checking that compares metric scores against minimums\n- Reports now include `passed` field (true if all thresholds pass) and `thresholds` array with per-metric results\n\n### 2. **Report Formatting** (`packages/frai-core/src/eval/reporters.js`)\n- Updated markdown reporter to include a \"Thresholds\" section showing PASS/FAIL status for each threshold\n\n### 3. **CLI Integration** (`packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`)\n- Added `--threshold <metric>=<min>` option (can be specified multiple times)\n- Added `parseThresholds()` to parse and validate threshold strings\n- Updated `runEvalCommand()` with proper exit code handling:\n  - Exit 0: all thresholds pass (or no thresholds specified)\n  - Exit 1: any threshold fails\n  - Exit 2: malformed threshold or unknown metric ID\n\n### 4. **Tests** (`packages/frai-core/src/eval/index.test.js`)\nAdded comprehensive tests covering:\n- Passing thresholds\n- Failing thresholds\n- Metrics with no score (correctly fail)\n- Invalid threshold values (>1 or <0)\n- Unknown metric IDs\n\n### 5. **Documentation**\n- Updated both `packages/frai-cli/README.md` and `packages/frai-core/README.md`\n- Added SDK example showing threshold usage in code\n\n## Behavior\n\n- **No thresholds**: Reports and exit codes remain exactly as before\n- **Valid thresholds**: Evaluates each metric against its threshold, fails if any score is null or below the minimum\n- **Invalid configuration**: Exits with code 2 and lists all validation errors (unknown metrics, out-of-range values)\n- **Threshold failures**: Exits with code 1 and includes failure details in reports\n\nAll custom verification tests pass successfully, confirming the implementation works correctly.",
